#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Batteries replaced too often: {first} d then {second} d (under 30 d)"
msgstr ""
"Pilas cambiadas con demasiada frecuencia: {first} d y luego {second} d "
"(menos de 30 d)"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
msgid ""
"Check the declared chemistry ([battery] chemistry), try fresh cells of "
"another batch or low self-discharge NiMH cells, and switch the keyboard off "
"when it is not used."
msgstr ""
"Compruebe la química declarada ([battery] chemistry), pruebe pilas nuevas de "
"otro lote o pilas NiMH de baja autodescarga, y apague el teclado cuando no "
"lo use."

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/alias.rs
#, rust-format
