"  0   success\n"
"  1   error (D-Bus failure, write refused, bad data)\n"
"  2   daemon absent (apple-kb-monitord not on the session bus)\n"
"  64  usage error (invalid arguments)\n"
"\n"
"FN MODES (hid_apple.fnmode, global to every Apple keyboard):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn key has no effect\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  media keys by default, Fn+Fx = F-key\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-keys by default, Fn+Fx = media key\n"
"  3  auto       kernel default: = 1 on an Apple keyboard\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-keys disabled (media keys only)"
msgstr ""
"CÓDIGOS DE SALIDA:\n"
"  0   éxito\n"
"  1   error (fallo de D-Bus, escritura rechazada, datos incorrectos)\n"
"  2   servicio ausente (apple-kb-monitord no está en el bus de sesión)\n"
"  64  error de uso (argumentos no válidos)\n"
"\n"
"MODOS FN (hid_apple.fnmode, global para todos los teclados Apple):\n"
"  0  disabled   la tecla Fn no tiene efecto\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  teclas multimedia por defecto, Fn+Fx = tecla F\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst teclas F por defecto, Fn+Fx = tecla multimedia\n"
"  3  auto       valor por defecto del kernel: = 1 en un teclado Apple\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled teclas F desactivadas (solo teclas multimedia)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
