#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"✗ Circuit breaker open: the keyboard did not answer 3 requests in a row, it "
"is mute (Apple's R3). RecantConnection (0x41) NOT sent, nothing removed. "
"Back to wake + reconnect."
msgstr ""
"✗ Disyuntor abierto: el teclado no respondió a 3 peticiones seguidas, está "
"mudo (R3 de Apple). RecantConnection (0x41) NO enviado, nada eliminado. "
"Vuelta a despertar + reconectar."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"✓ Keyboard reconnected, pairing intact: the breaker closes on the new "
"connection; run `akmctl repair` again if the forget is still needed."
msgstr ""
"✓ Teclado reconectado, emparejamiento intacto: el disyuntor se cierra con la "
"nueva conexión; vuelva a ejecutar `akmctl repair` si aún hace falta "
"olvidarlo."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"✗ The keyboard does not answer. Switch it off and on (light at power-on), "
"check its batteries, then run `akmctl repair` again."
msgstr ""
"✗ El teclado no responde. Apáguelo y enciéndalo (luz al encender), compruebe "
"sus pilas y vuelva a ejecutar `akmctl repair`."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
